      "Rounded hypoallergenic blade tips protect moles and back acne",
      "Lithium-ion battery gives a reliable 60-minute runtime",
      "Dual-sided head: trimmer on one end, foil shaver on the other",
      "Three guard combs (3mm, 5mm, 7mm) for length control",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Torque is noticeably lower than the Mangroomer on thick patches",
      "Modular back extension arm is shorter reach than dedicated shavers",
    ],
    specs: {
      "Battery Type": "Lithium-ion (built-in, rechargeable)",
      "Runtime": "60 min continuous use",
      "Charge Time": "~1 hour to full",
      "Waterproof Rating": "IPX7 (fully submersible, shower-safe)",
      "Motor / Torque": "Single motor, standard torque",
      "Attachment Heads": "Foil shaver + trimmer + 3 guard combs",
      "Charging Method": "USB charging stand",
    },
    bottomLine:
      "The gentle, shower-safe option. If you groom in the shower and have sensitive skin, moles, or back acne, this is the only electric shaver on this list built for that use case.",
    descriptionParagraphs: [
      "Waterproofing is the entire pitch here, and Philips backs it with a genuine **IPX7 rating** — not a marketing term, but a certified standard meaning the unit can be **fully submerged in up to 1 meter of water for 30 minutes** without damage. Practically, that means you can shave in a running shower, rinse the whole unit under the faucet, or drop it in the sink without a second thought. None of the other battery-powered shavers we tested carry a true IPX7 rating; most are rinsable-only or 'washable' at best.",
      "The motor trades some torque for that waterproofing and the rounded, hypoallergenic blade geometry. On our thick-hair stall test, the Bodygroom 5000 needed **noticeably slower passes** to avoid bogging down compared to the Mangroomer's Power Burst mode. But for men with reactive skin, moles, or active back acne, that gentler cut is a feature, not a bug — the rounded tips genuinely can't dig in the way a foil shaver's more aggressive competitors can. The **lithium-ion battery** delivers a dependable 60 minutes per charge, and the included USB charging stand means you're never hunting for a proprietary brick.",
    ],
  },
  {
    id: "hatteker-4in1-back-shaver",
    name: "Hatteker 4-in-1 Electric Back Shaver",
    category: "Electric Body Groomer (Battery)",
    price: 29.99,
