      "Rinseable head design for quick cleanup",
      "Lithium-ion battery with a 60-minute run time per charge",
      "Charge indicator light shows low-battery warning in advance",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Not shower-submersible — head is rinseable only, not the full body",
      "No dedicated long-reach back handle in the base kit",
