        <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500 opacity-50">/</span>
        <a
          href="/best-of"
          class="hover:text-white transition-colors no-underline text-gray-300 font-medium"
          >Best Lists</a
        >
        <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500 opacity-50">/</span>
        <span class="text-[#38BDF8] font-bold">Electric Back Shaver</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <TrustBadge />
      </div>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl tracking-tight font-black text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-tight"
      >
        Best Electric Back Shaver in 2026:
        <span class="block text-[#38BDF8] mt-2">Battery-Powered Tools Tested</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-300 sm:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        You've already decided: <span class="text-white font-bold italic"
          >electric, not manual</span
        >. So we skipped every razor-style shaver and tested only battery-powered
        tools — comparing motor torque, IPX waterproof ratings, battery runtime,
        and attachment heads so you can pick the right one.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
