            Days of Battery/Motor Testing
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[#38BDF8]">3</p>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium mt-1">
