        <p>Specifically, we measured four things manual razor reviews simply can't: <strong class="text-gray-900">motor torque</strong> (does it stall on thick hair?), <strong class="text-gray-900">battery runtime</strong> (sessions per charge?), <strong class="text-gray-900">IPX waterproof rating</strong> (shower-safe, or just rinsable?), and <strong class="text-gray-900">attachment head systems</strong> (how many jobs can one motor handle?). Want a direct electric-vs-manual comparison instead? Our full roundup linked above covers both categories with the same testing rigor.</p>
